  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A hemispherical glass body of radius 10 cm and refractive index 1.5 is silvered on its curved surface. A small air bubble is 6 cm below the flat surface inside it along the axis. The position of the image of the air bubble made by the mirror is seen :<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0231_fe8c11f78464.png\" style=\"width: 298px; height: 150px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "14cm below flat surface",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "20cm below flat surface",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "16cm below flat surface",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "30cm below flat surface",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mirror image<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math><br /><br />So, it is 30 cm below flat surface.<br /><br />Now, After refraction<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0231_43238b11e63f.png\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 250px;\" /></p>"
  }
